Key UML Relationships (Important to Explain in Interview)
1️⃣ Composition
    GameService owns UserProgress
    Lifecycle tied to the game session
2️⃣ Interface-based polymorphism
    GameService → GuessEvaluator
    GameService → GameRules
This allows:
Different evaluation logic
Different rule sets (easy / hard mode)

3️⃣ No circular dependencies
    All arrows point towards abstractions
    Concrete classes sit at the edges
This is a big Microsoft design plus.


┌────────────────────────┐
│       GameService      │
├────────────────────────┤
│ - dailyWord : String   │
│ - evaluator : GuessEvaluator |
│ - rules : GameRules    │
│ - userProgressMap : Map<String, UserProgress> |
│ - locks : Map<String, ReentrantLock> |
├────────────────────────┤
│ + submitGuess(userId, guess) : TurnResult |
└───────────┬────────────┘
            │
            │ uses
            ▼
┌────────────────────────┐
│     GuessEvaluator      │<<interface>>
├────────────────────────┤
│ + evaluate(word, guess): TurnResult |
└───────────┬────────────┘
            │ implements
            ▼
┌────────────────────────┐
│ DefaultGuessEvaluator  │
├────────────────────────┤
│ + evaluate(word, guess)|
└────────────────────────┘


┌────────────────────────┐
│        GameRules        │<<interface>>
├────────────────────────┤
│ + validate(progress)   │
│ + nextStatus(progress, result) |
└───────────┬────────────┘
            │ implements
            ▼
┌────────────────────────┐
│   DefaultGameRules     │
├────────────────────────┤
│ - maxAttempts : int    │
│ + validate()           │
│ + nextStatus()         │
└────────────────────────┘


UML Class Diagram – Daily Word Puzzle Game

+----------------------+
|  DailyWordPuzzleGame |
+----------------------+
|  main(String[])      |
+----------+-----------+
           |
           v
+----------------------+
|     GameService      |
+----------------------+
| - dailyWord          |
| - evaluator          |
| - rules              |
| - userProgressMap    |
| - locks              |
+----------------------+
| + submitGuess()      |
+----+------------+----+
     |              |
     v              v
+---------------+     +-------------+
| GuessEvaluator   |  | GameRules   |
+---------------+     +--------------+
| + evaluate() |   | + validate()   |
|              |   | + nextStatus() |
+------+-------+   +------+------+
       |                 |
       v                 v
+--------------------+  +--------------------+
| DefaultGuessEvaluator |  | DefaultGameRules |
+--------------------+  +--------------------+
| + evaluate()       |  | - maxAttempts      |
+--------------------+  | + validate()       |
                        | + nextStatus()     |
                        +--------------------+

